# System Architecture

## Overview

The Susee Finance Loan Application Automation is designed as a digital loan-entry workflow using Zoho Creator and Deluge scripting.

The solution connects form submission, validation, loan number generation, EMI date calculation, maturity date calculation, and automated email notification into a single workflow.

## Process Flow

```text
Business Executive
        ↓
Loan Application Form
        ↓
Form Validation
        ↓
System Status Check
        ↓
Loan Sequence Management
        ↓
First EMI Date Calculation
        ↓
Maturity Date Calculation
        ↓
Automated Email Notification
